{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_018ELmqZR5VxLCX1nvvj875i", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://artsandculture.google.com/asset/wd/qwGpXUCsX0RPAQ\"}, {\"url\": \"https://artsandculture.google.com/asset/the-problem-we-all-live-with/qwGpXUCsX0RPAQ\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nrm.org/?p=25345\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nrm.org/?p=64467\"}, {\"url\": \"https://fristartmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/rockwell_gg_fin.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mentalfloss.com/art/artists/norman-rockwell-facts\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mentalfloss.com/article/74842/norman-rockwell-facts\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.airspacemag.com/space/norman-rockwells-ghost-9092689\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.historynewsnetwork.org/article/181856\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.smithsonianmag.com/air-space-magazine/norman-rockwells-ghost-9092689/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:28:54.457Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Norman Rockwell first assignment for Look magazine", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_012GTULyfnWnA2M6iH8MF9ih", "content": [{"title": "artsandculture.google.com", "url": "https://artsandculture.google.com/asset/wd/qwGpXUCsX0RPAQ"}, {"title": "artsandculture.google.com", "url": "https://artsandculture.google.com/asset/the-problem-we-all-live-with/qwGpXUCsX0RPAQ"}, {"title": "nrm.org", "url": "https://nrm.org/?p=25345"}, {"title": "Changing Times: Norman Rockwell’s Art for Look Magazine", "url": "https://nrm.org/?p=64467"}, {"title": "rockwell gg fin", "url": "https://fristartmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/rockwell_gg_fin.pdf"}, {"title": "15 Colorful Facts About Norman Rockwell", "url": "https://www.mentalfloss.com/art/artists/norman-rockwell-facts"}, {"title": "norman rockwell facts", "url": "https://mentalfloss.com/article/74842/norman-rockwell-facts"}, {"title": "Norman Rockwell’s Ghost", "url": "https://www.airspacemag.com/space/norman-rockwells-ghost-9092689"}, {"title": "With support from the University of Richmond", "url": "https://www.historynewsnetwork.org/article/181856"}, {"title": "norman rockwells ghost 9092689", "url": "https://www.smithsonianmag.com/air-space-magazine/norman-rockwells-ghost-9092689/"}]}, "Rockwell's first assignment for Look was **\"The Problem We All Live With,\"** a 1964 illustration of a six-year-old Black schoolgirl and four federal marshals on her way into an all-white New Orleans school. The Norman Rockwell Museum says the work ran in the magazine's January 14, 1964 issue Illustration for \"Look,\" January 14, 1964.\n\nThe piece followed his departure from The Saturday Evening Post. He left the Post in 1963 after a conflict over how it wanted him to depict Black Americans. After including two Black children in his 1961 illustration \"Golden Rule,\" Rockwell began receiving hate mail from segregationists, and the Post's instructions clashed with his conscience. The Frist Art Museum adds that the image was inspired by young Ruby Bridges's story."], "durationSeconds": 5.942507041999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_018ELmqZR5VxLCX1nvvj875i", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDVMs41FbdnMAruJvNj5", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：** 洛克威尔给《Look》杂志画的第一幅作品叫 **\"The Problem We All Live With\"**（《我们共同面对的问题》）。这幅画登在 1964 年 1 月 14 日那一期上，画面是 Ruby Bridges 在四名联邦法警护送下走进新奥尔良一所只收白人的学校。\n\n搜了 1 次。\n\nSources:\n- [Google Arts & Culture – The Problem We All Live With](https://artsandculture.google.com/asset/the-problem-we-all-live-with/qwGpXUCsX0RPAQ)\n- [Norman Rockwell Museum](https://nrm.org/?p=25345)\n- [Changing Times: Norman Rockwell's Art for Look Magazine](https://nrm.org/?p=64467)\n- [Frist Art Museum 展览资料](https://fristartmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/rockwell_gg_fin.pdf)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 999, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4286, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 999}, "output_tokens": 331, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:28:58.600Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDVMrmdZAGZZXLr6hJvv"}
